<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13068" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόληψις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπολαμβάνω</span> IV) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>intercepting, cutting off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπλιτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.54
				</span></i>
			; <i>stoppage,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιμηνίων, οὔρων,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				1.51
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.7
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					3.21.1
				</span></i>
			; <i>imprisonment,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνεύματος ἐν τῇ γῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					2p.48U.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ποδός</span>”
				<i>constrained position,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					62
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>refutation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				5.261
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>reception,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς φιλίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>D.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				84
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				10.2.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>clamp, holdfast,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				57.44
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>repayment,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phalar.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				27
			</span></i>.</div>
